  "name": "eot-bench-data",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tLiveKit EoT Benchmark\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains a minimal public subset of the LiveKit end-of-turn\nbenchmark. It is sampled from the full release-ready dataset preserved on the\nfull revision.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tLinks\n\t\n\n\nBlog post: Solving end-of-turn detection\nBenchmark code: github.com/livekit/eot-bench\n\nThe sample is deterministic: up to 400 turns per language were sampled\nwithout replacement using seed 20260603. Languages with fewer than the requested sample size include all available\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/livekit/eot-bench-data.",
